  "collectedAt": "2026-04-27T12:35:55.139815",
  "date": "2026-04-27",
  "posts": [
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Me and everyone I know after this weekend.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2048575830750568940",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-27T01:31:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I honestly can't even believe I have to address this - no one has ever paid me to tweet anything, ever. And no one until today has ever called me a \"MAGA influencer\". \n\nJust absolute nonsense.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2048524343957655854",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T22:07:17+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Stevie Nicks.\n\n\nThe Academy (@TheAcademy)\n\nIf you could greenlight one music biopic tomorrow, who are you choosing?\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/TheAcademy/status/2048497093472387573#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2048520835829321956",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T21:53:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I am so deeply sick of Jimmy Kimmel and the hate he spreads in the world.\n\n\nLibby Emmons (@libbyemmons)\n\nJimmy Kimmel delivered a fake White House Correspondents Dinner speech, saying \"Mrs. Trump, you have a glow like an expectant widow.\"\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/libbyemmons/status/2048452196417655243#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2048469805846446179",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T18:30:35+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I don\u2019t want to hear one more fucking criticism of Trump\u2019s new ballroom at the White House.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2048218607243424207",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T01:52:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Pray for our country. There is such evil in this world.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2048213144447644104",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T01:30:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This \ud83d\udc47\ud83c\udffb\n\n\nTom Cotton (@SenTomCotton)\n\nMarijuana today is much more potent than just ten or twenty years ago, leading to increased psychosis, anti-social behavior, and fatal car crashes. Arkansans don\u2019t want more dangerous drugs obtained more easily. A change to marijuana\u2019s drug classification is a step in the wrong direction.\nCommunity note: Tom is lying - Opinion polls consistently show that Arkansans favor legalizing marijuana:\n\nthv11.com/article/news/p\u2026\n\nualrpublicradio.org/local-regional\u2026\n\nT",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2047369429239910829",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T17:38:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "One thing I\u2019m proud of as I have aged and grown in my faith is a capacity to forgive as Christ teaches us.\n\nI have also learned that hating someone daily is like drinking poison and only hurts me. Things in life really play out as they should and I choose to live in light.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2047367279956943205",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T17:29:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"I didn't take any actions, but I seriously considered it.\"\n\nIf a major political win can't protect someone from going to a very dark place, there is a national mental health crisis we can't ignore.\n\nWatch my full conversation with @SenFettermanPA here: piped.video/aGg5Y8OYIMY\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2047311311025864737",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T13:47:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
